## 2. Independent re-score of the best version, V_034

`Scripts/MusicCritic.py --version V_034` recomputes the third-octave time-frequency score (nFft 4096, hop 2048, JND 2 dB, 30 Hz to 16 kHz) from the WAV files, independently of the pipeline. Agreement with the stored score: 0.000 on every stem (other: -0.001). Log: `/Users/zenray/.claude/tmp/tmp-zenray-motion-design/docs/build/M3-logs/critic-V_034.json`.

| Stem | tfBands V_025 | tfBands V_034 | onsetF | chroma | envCorr | plossBarNoOnset |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| drums | 88.73 | **96.27** | 0.903 | 0.969 | 0.979 | 78.4 |
| bass | 93.46 | **97.71** | 0.629 | 0.981 | 0.979 | 70.5 |
| other | 93.73 | **94.72** | 0.544 | 0.889 | 0.921 | 67.4 |
